  {"id": "item-desc:a1b2c3d4/1140", "version": 843, "as_of": 1794158400000, "body": {"id": "atp-1140", "description": "**What is asked**\nHow many answered questions History keeps per team. It reaches you because it changes what you can look back on.\n\n**Options**\n- 10 (open runs): the slice as it is; no new verb.\n- 50 (needs a list verb): adds `ah msg history --team <t> --limit 50`.\n- Not needed: History stays at 10 and the item closes.\n\n**Where**\n`herdr-desktop/mods/ah2/qa.js` draws History; the cap is `HISTORY_CAP` in `model.js`.\n"}}
